{"canonical_id":"xuanwei-lun","title":"玄微论","author":"陈希夷（宋）","edition":"网络公版整理","publication_date":"","source_url":"https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1080241754543751172","access_date":"2026-09-02","license":"公有领域","volume":"","chapter":"正文","section":"","seq":1,"segId":"xuanwei-lun.1","text":"希夷先生曰：斗数之列众星，由大易之分八卦，八卦非彖系不明，五星非讲明何措，是以观斗数者，再三审动静之机，第一辨宾主之分，动静循环不已，主宾更迭无拘，主若无情，何宾之有，宾不能对，何足取哉！","normalized_text":"希夷先生曰：斗数之列众星，由大易之分八卦，八卦非彖系不明，五星非讲明何措，是以观斗数者，再三审动静之机，第一辨宾主之分，动静循环不已，主宾更迭无拘，主若无情，何宾之有，宾不能对，何足取哉！","charRange":[0,94],"tags":["ziwei"],"annotations":"","transcription_confidence":0.9,"isPublicDomain":true,"confidence_level":"A"}
{"canonical_id":"xuanwei-lun","title":"玄微论","author":"陈希夷（宋）","edition":"网络公版整理","publication_date":"","source_url":"https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1080241754543751172","access_date":"2026-09-02","license":"公有领域","volume":"","chapter":"正文","section":"","seq":2,"segId":"xuanwei-lun.2","text":"凡观女人之命，先观夫子二宫，若值煞星，定三嫁而心不足，或逢羊陀，须啼哭而泪不干。","normalized_text":"凡观女人之命，先观夫子二宫，若值煞星，定三嫁而心不足，或逢羊陀，须啼哭而泪不干。","charRange":[0,40],"tags":["ziwei"],"annotations":"","transcription_confidence":0.9,"isPublicDomain":true,"confidence_level":"A"}
{"canonical_id":"xuanwei-lun","title":"玄微论","author":"陈希夷（宋）","edition":"网络公版整理","publication_date":"","source_url":"https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1080241754543751172","access_date":"2026-09-02","license":"公有领域","volume":"","chapter":"正文","section":"","seq":3,"segId":"xuanwei-lun.3","text":"若观男命，始以福财为主，再审迁移如何，二限相因，吉凶同断。","normalized_text":"若观男命，始以福财为主，再审迁移如何，二限相因，吉凶同断。","charRange":[0,29],"tags":["ziwei"],"annotations":"","transcription_confidence":0.9,"isPublicDomain":true,"confidence_level":"A"}
{"canonical_id":"xuanwei-lun","title":"玄微论","author":"陈希夷（宋）","edition":"网络公版整理","publication_date":"","source_url":"https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1080241754543751172","access_date":"2026-09-02","license":"公有领域","volume":"","chapter":"正文","section":"","seq":4,"segId":"xuanwei-lun.4","text":"君子命中亦有羊陀四杀，小人命中岂无科禄权星，要看得垣失垣，专论入庙失陷。","normalized_text":"君子命中亦有羊陀四杀，小人命中岂无科禄权星，要看得垣失垣，专论入庙失陷。","charRange":[0,36],"tags":["ziwei"],"annotations":"","transcription_confidence":0.9,"isPublicDomain":true,"confidence_level":"A"}
{"canonical_id":"xuanwei-lun","title":"玄微论","author":"陈希夷（宋）","edition":"网络公版整理","publication_date":"","source_url":"https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1080241754543751172","access_date":"2026-09-02","license":"公有领域","volume":"","chapter":"正文","section":"","seq":5,"segId":"xuanwei-lun.5","text":"若论小儿，详推童限，小儿命生凶乡，三五岁必然夭折，更有限逢恶杀，五七岁必至夭亡。","normalized_text":"若论小儿，详推童限，小儿命生凶乡，三五岁必然夭折，更有限逢恶杀，五七岁必至夭亡。","charRange":[0,40],"tags":["ziwei"],"annotations":"","transcription_confidence":0.9,"isPublicDomain":true,"confidence_level":"A"}
{"canonical_id":"xuanwei-lun","title":"玄微论","author":"陈希夷（宋）","edition":"网络公版整理","publication_date":"","source_url":"https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1080241754543751172","access_date":"2026-09-02","license":"公有领域","volume":"","chapter":"正文","section":"","seq":6,"segId":"xuanwei-lun.6","text":"如武破廉贪，固深谋而贵显，加羊陀空劫，反小志以孤寒。","normalized_text":"如武破廉贪，固深谋而贵显，加羊陀空劫，反小志以孤寒。","charRange":[0,26],"tags":["ziwei"],"annotations":"","transcription_confidence":0.9,"isPublicDomain":true,"confidence_level":"A"}
